      "order": 15,
      "text": "CommitmentDiscountQuantity MUST be the metered quantity of CommitmentDiscountUnit that is consumed in a given *charge period* when [CommitmentDiscountStatus](#datasets.costandusage.commitmentdiscountstatus) is \"Used\".",
